1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,578
Each grain changes the pressure by only a tiny amount, so the gas is always almost exactly in equilibrium.

2
00:00:07,578 --> 00:00:10,416
The point creeps along a smooth curve.

3
00:00:10,416 --> 00:00:19,635
That idealised, infinitely slow process is called quasi static, and only quasi static processes can be drawn as curves.

